      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should train your staff to recognize different types of \"difficult\" customers based on their demeanor and behavior. Some archetypes might include the overly demanding shopper who expects special treatment, the overly aggressive complainer, or the suspicious individual who seems to be casing the store. These profiles allow staff to adjust their level of service and security awareness appropriately.",
